comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T12:39:52.841Z",codex-root-agent,"Duplicate-check evidence: exact run/error and all-status cross-platform searches found no current item owning this five-test nightly regression. Historical Windows and Bun/SQLite items cover different root failures and remain linked as lineage."
  "2026-07-24T12:40:42.213Z",codex-root-agent,"Implementation start: claimed as an actively worked part of the broad SDK workspace mutation integrity PR. TDD scope covers deterministic id allocation, atomic stale-lock takeover, init cache and merge-fence ownership, schema migration idempotency/recovery, cross-runtime machine channels, and the fixed 10k performance gate."
  "2026-07-24T13:35:06.471Z",codex-root-agent,"Local completion evidence pending hosted confirmation: the exact five-file Node 22.21.1 regression set passed 57 tests with clean stderr after stable-runtime SQLite gating; final full suite passed 6220 tests at 100/100/100/100 on Node 26. Windows-targeted tests already use deterministic capability seams rather than chmod assumptions. This remains in progress until the new PR supplies exact hosted Node 22 and Windows proof, per acceptance."
  "2026-07-24T13:49:02.791Z",codex-root-agent,"Delivery PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/673 (broad SDK workspace mutation and migration primitives)."
  "2026-07-24T13:57:36.986Z",codex-root-agent,"Hosted Windows finding and repair: PR run 30098423259 job 89498351984 exposed Git's C:\\Users\\RUNNER~1 short-path spelling versus Node's C:\\Users\\runneradmin long-path spelling, causing a false outside-repository rejection. installMergeFence now canonicalizes both existing roots with realpath before containment comparison while preserving caller-facing paths. Added a symlink/junction-equivalent identity regression. Focused SDK/init verification passed 49 tests; typecheck and lint passed. Awaiting replacement hosted Node/Windows proof before closure."
  "2026-07-24T14:02:31.668Z",codex-root-agent,"Second hosted Windows refinement: replacement run 30099021265 job 89500278101 proved containment now succeeds, but the success-warning assertion exposed Git's 8.3 spelling. findGitWorkspaceRoot now canonicalizes Git's reported root at the discovery boundary, keeping internal checks and public result paths consistent. Re-ran the 49-test SDK/init focus plus typecheck successfully; full coverage command also completed successfully after the first repair."
  "2026-07-24T14:08:10.503Z",codex-root-agent,"Third hosted Windows refinement: run 30099359545 job 89501419763 showed production containment and canonical output were correct; the test fixture's mkdtemp path remained in 8.3 form while the SDK result used the long canonical form. Updated the assertion to require the exact merge-fence warning and compare the referenced file by realpath identity. Focused 49 tests, typecheck, ESLint, zero-duplicate gate, 100% docstring static gate, package-boundary audit, and token-budget gate all pass."
  "2026-07-24T14:16:43.704Z",codex-root-agent,"Hosted acceptance complete at PR head ebf0443eaf9ac4d9bcf04332ffb3476d4026fae4: CI run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/30099757539 passed. Ubuntu Node 22 smoke job 89503618661 passed with clean channels; Windows Node 24 regression rerun job 89503591212 passed all 903 tests; all four coverage shards and aggregate 100% coverage, static, typecheck, compatibility, runtime, and smoke gates passed. The first Windows attempt had two unrelated simultaneous 30-second runner timeouts; the unchanged failed-job rerun passed, confirming runner contention rather than a code regression."
